lly when some noob shoots you in the back:p\n\nBtw. some additional campaigns are in the internet ! You internet have? You download them have to.", "timestamp_created": 1339687031, "timestamp_updated": 1415201232, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.557815074920654297", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "5562883", "author": {"steamid": "76561198051976529", "personaname": "Thunderstorm NATO", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198051976529/", "num_games_owned": 77, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 94, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 94, "last_played": 1324281600, "avatar": "d6a5a92f48d2c2c2b6c919e23a0ae064d96f311c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Игра классная но сложная", "timestamp_created": 1339648031, "timestamp_updated": 1339648031, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}